   "key": "Morning, a small suburban kitchen with yellow walls, white cabinets and a white fridge with fruit magnets, sun coming through plaid curtains. Medium shot of the fat bald plumber with the thick brown mustache in blue overalls over a white t-shirt, no other shirt. Both of his hands hold one big brown cardboard sign still at chest height; it fills the lower half of the frame. The sign reads FREE ESTIMATES, handwritten in thick black marker, with no other words. His chin is up, he looks proud, and his eyes look toward frame left. Keep the top third of the frame clear yellow wall.",
   "move": "he says it proudly, looking to frame left, and lifts only his chin; the sign stays still at chest height in both hands so the letters stay readable"
  },
