   "key": "Dusk, the ceiling light on in a beige kitchen. The camera sits inside an open white sink cabinet near the pipes, looking out. The fat bald plumber with the thick brown mustache, in blue overalls over a white t-shirt, kneels on the kitchen floor and leans his head and shoulders into the cabinet, his face upright, the cabinet's open doorway framing him. His chin is low in the frame, eyes open looking up at a chrome pipe joint. One small grey smear of pipe grime is on his left cheek, the cheek at frame right. His left hand holds a small black flashlight low at the bottom-left edge of the frame, away from his mouth, pointed up at the chrome pipe, and the light bouncing off the chrome lights his face. In the foreground at frame right, large and clear, one red-handled pipe wrench lies on the white cabinet floor; it is a red-handled pipe wrench, not pliers, a hammer or a phone. His right hand is out of frame.",
